      "value": "<p>Upon achieving 20th level, the astrologian's rapport with the heavens grants her perfect harmony with the universe. She receives an insight bonus on all saving throws equal to her Wisdom modifier. She automatically stabilizes if she is below 0 hit points, is immune to fear effects and to critical hits. Should the astrologian die, she is reborn 3 days later in the form of a star child, who matures over the course of 7 days (treat as the raise spell).</p>",
